### Chat Bubble UI Components (Internal)

The pre-built chat bubble is composed of these React components:

```typescript
<AxonChatBubbleContainer>
  {/* Floating button (when minimized) */}
  <ChatToggleButton
    onClick={toggle}
    hasUnread={hasUnread}
    isOpen={isOpen}
  />

  {/* Main chat window (when open) */}
  <ChatWindow isOpen={isOpen}>
    {/* Header */}
    <ChatHeader>
      <ConversationTitle>
        {conversation?.title ?? 'New Conversation'}
      </ConversationTitle>
      <ConversationMenu>
        <NewConversationButton />
        <HistoryButton />
        <SettingsButton />
      </ConversationMenu>
      <CloseButton onClick={toggle} />
    </ChatHeader>

    {/* Messages */}
    <MessageList ref={scrollRef}>
      {messages.map(msg => (
        <Message
          key={msg.messageId}
          role={msg.role}
          content={msg.content}
          timestamp={msg.createdAt}
          onCopy={() => copyToClipboard(msg.content)}
          onRetry={msg.role === 'user' ? () => retry(msg) : undefined}
        />
      ))}

      {isTyping && <TypingIndicator />}
      {error && <ErrorMessage error={error} onRetry={retry} />}

      <div ref={bottomRef} />  {/* Auto-scroll anchor */}
    </MessageList>

    {/* Input */}
    <MessageInput
      value={input}
      onChange={setInput}
      onSubmit={handleSubmit}
      disabled={isLoading || !isAuthenticated}
      placeholder={isAuthenticated ? placeholder : "Connect wallet to chat"}
    />

    {/* Auth prompt (if not authenticated) */}
    {!isAuthenticated && (
      <AuthPrompt>
        <p>Connect your wallet to start chatting</p>
        <button onClick={signIn}>Connect Wallet</button>
      </AuthPrompt>
    )}
  </ChatWindow>

  {/* Conversation history sidebar (optional) */}
  {showHistory && (
    <ConversationHistory
      conversations={conversations}
      onSelect={selectConversation}
      onClose={() => setShowHistory(false)}
    />
  )}
</AxonChatBubbleContainer>
```

**Features:**

- ✅ **Auto-scroll to latest message** (smooth scrolling)
- ✅ **Markdown support** (code blocks, links, lists, bold, italic)
- ✅ **Syntax highlighting** (for code blocks)
- ✅ **Copy message button** (copy to clipboard)
- ✅ **Retry failed messages** (if send fails)
- ✅ **Typing indicator** (animated dots while AI thinks)
- ✅ **Loading states** (skeleton screens)
- ✅ **Error states** (inline error messages with retry button)
- ✅ **Conversation switching** (sidebar with history)
- ✅ **New conversation button** (start fresh)
- ✅ **Responsive design** (mobile, tablet, desktop)
- ✅ **Keyboard shortcuts** (Enter to send, Shift+Enter for newline)
- ✅ **Accessibility** (ARIA labels, keyboard navigation, screen reader support)

